## Released firmware images

The `.bin` images and the `tessel-restore.tar.gz` / `tessel-update.tar.gz`
archives published under
[Releases](https://github.com/aaronpowell/tessel-2-revive/releases) are builds
of OpenWrt. They aggregate the Linux kernel, musl, BusyBox, U-Boot, Node.js and
many other components, each under its own licence — predominantly GPL-2.0.

Corresponding source is available from:

- upstream OpenWrt, at the release tag the image was built from (recorded in
  `/etc/tessel-release` on the device as `OPENWRT_VERSION`), and
- this repository, for the patches and configuration applied on top —
  everything under `build/openwrt-incremental/overlay/`.

`build/openwrt-incremental/build.sh` clones stock upstream OpenWrt and applies
only that overlay, so those two together are the complete source for a given
image.

